1135	     headlines here run at line-height:.8-1 - tight enough that a
1136	     descender (g, y, p) gets sliced by that box's own bottom edge. Give
1137	     every mask wrapper a hair of bottom breathing room via padding+
1138	     matching negative margin, so the box grows without shifting layout
1139	     (the negative margin cancels the padding's added height). ----- */
