/* R10 §10 M1: opacity, not visibility - visibility:hidden took the case headings out of the
   accessibility tree until the reader had scrolled there. Kept only if section_probe still shows
   one iframe load and no refresh (R10-BESLUT § 7). */
.showcase-stage.is-far{opacity:0;}
/* R10 T1: the process photo's tiles, laid over the frame where the growing photo lands; they
   dissolve to show the live site. Never on the iframe itself (PRODUCT.md: a shown frame is
   never transformed or faded). */
